---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Last of Us Part II Remastered — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="The Last of Us Part II Remastered buying guide: what's new, the PS4 upgrade, and where to buy the digital PS5 version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>The Last of Us Part II Remastered — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>The Last of Us Part II Remastered</strong> brings Naughty Dog's divisive,
      gorgeous action-drama to PS5 with higher framerates, graphical upgrades, and a new
      roguelike mode, <em>No Return</em>.
    </p>

    <h2>What's in the Remastered version</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>60 fps performance mode</strong> — the biggest upgrade over the PS4 original</li>
      <li><strong>No Return</strong> — a standalone roguelike survival mode</li>
      <li><strong>PS4 owners</strong> — can upgrade to the PS5 remaster for a small fee rather than rebuying</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Should you rebuy?</h2>
    <p>
      If you own the PS4 version, the cheap upgrade is the smart move. New players should
      just buy the PS5 remaster. Discounts tend to track the HBO show's seasons, so watch
      for cuts then.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=last+of+us+part+2+remastered+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Last+of+Us+Part+II+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
